<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fannie Mae started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fannie Mae started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities confirmed on Tuesday it started coverage of Fannie Mae with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $57 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Jonathon Adams said his 1997 earnings estimate was $2.80 per share and his 1999 estimate was $3.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Fannie Mae is the premier entity in the mortgage market right now,&quot; Adams said.  &quot;We think securitization trends are also very favorable for this company.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Fannie Mae stock lost 1/8 to 44-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
